seg-73a5899de383 = Source: the Norwegian Public Roads Administration's <c1/> repository (<a1>https://github.com/NPRA/jammertest-plan</a1>), <b>MIT licence</b> (copyright { "2024" } Norwegian Public Roads Administration; the licence text is checked in <c2/>). The files are fetched, never vendored:

