seg-382613112d5d = What a result does not say

# text
seg-f1cb12a89001 = A planned slot is not an on-air record. A transmitter may have started late, stopped early or never run; a "missed" test can be a test that did not transmit, and a latency is from the planned start.

# text
seg-32baa4a4b9f0 = A "clean" epoch is "outside the planned slots", not "proven interference-free".

# text
seg-95cc22bbacc5 = Detection by measurement-domain monitors says nothing about detecting a low-power, coherent spoofer.

# text
seg-2e91813cf9d7 = No external oracle states the true on-air times, so nothing here is VALIDATED.

